5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move furniture, I need to understand the actual monthly cost of this floor.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know which spots are quiet and comfortable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Victoria, that’s a start, but I care about the daily grind. How long does the switch actually eat into our mornings?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m not interested in comfort or cost. I want to know who gets the worst seats, and why we never discuss that openly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to know who I'll sit next to. It changes how much I talk to everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the morning routine data will show that. @Shunichi, the survey might explain the seating bias.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
