60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, Option A is the only one that avoids the 6,200 yen penalty. We must assign seats permanently to stop the financial bleed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. But please, can I have the window side? The printer row is too loud, and my chair needs time to settle.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, the window is nice, but I need to know if my morning gaps survive. @Victoria, does Option A protect my time?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, Option A freezes the bias. If we pick it, I want the window seats explicitly named, not left to chance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. But if I’m fixed in a corner, I won’t hear the new joiners. I need to be near the center.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, Option A protects your time by eliminating the daily scramble. @Daisuke, we can place you centrally to preserve those connections.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, thank you. If I can have the quiet window seat, I will be very happy. It feels safe.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, eliminating the scramble is great, but does it guarantee I won’t get stuck in a noisy corner? I need certainty, not just hope.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, certainty comes from explicit assignment. If we name the seats, you know exactly where you sit. No surprises, no noise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, if I’m central, I hear the new joiners. But @May, will I still have my quiet gaps?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@May, certainty comes from the plan. @Daisuke, central placement preserves your connections. @Minato, the window seat is yours.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Daisuke"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, thank you. That is wonderful. I feel much safer knowing my chair will finally settle.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if I’m guaranteed a quiet, central spot, I’m in. But I need that written down, not just promised.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, written down means the floor plan. No verbal promises. @Daisuke, central placement is non-negotiable for your learning.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. If I’m central, I can hear the new joiners. I’ll vote for A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
